 sound/soc/mediatek/mt8195/mt8195-dai-etdm.c | 177 +++++++++++++++++---
 sound/soc/mediatek/mt8195/mt8195-dai-pcm.c  |  26 ++-
 3 files changed, 185 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)

